# fh001, the three stories (doc 84 §9.7): the luna table of cty_bramble_snowhearth, ported. The priest and the trader it
# named are gone; her faith is in the Bright One.
mantle fh001
state ready
dialect frosthollow
accent light
tier standard
written_for cty_bramble_snowhearth
title the three stories
fits stage=adult|old
traits temper=short piety=devout
quirk tells_the_same_three_stories
likes good_seams
dislikes boasting
fears losing_it_all
hopes to_keep_what_she_won
topics faith +.3 work +.2
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# digs ore: plain-spoken, short of temper, devout and private, telling the same three stories whenever talk lulls.

words
saying! = Every seam remembers the pick | Stone keeps what tongues spill
oath! = By the deep dark | Cold iron take me
greet = Warm hearth to you | Hearth and lamp
farewell = Keep your flame sheltered | Lamp bright
agree = Aye, solid

rule @seam
when concept=bark working=yes self.job=miner
does aside
cooldown 6h
say Listen, and the good seam tells you where it sleeps. | This ore is solid. The mountain knows its worth.

story ridgemere [concept=talk.memories self.age>=25]
  : I went down to the city once with nothing, and came back with less.
  : Took me three winters at the face to fill the purse again.
  b : And you never went back?
  : #oath#. Not for all the ore in the hills.

scene faith
when concept=talk.faith
does give.opinion / agree
a : Faith holds when stone does not. I believe that.
b : The Bright One keeps the roof up, they say.

line greet.return : #greet#. You've come at a sound hour.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#. Best not boast of it before the pick comes down.
line react.news.known : Old news. Still, it bears telling.
line answer.how : Sound as a good seam.

dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #greet#, #topic.player#. Sit; I've a story, if you've the time.
